
>> santaLaugh := ['ho'].
>> laugh := [''].
{ laugh := laugh + santaLaugh. } × 3.
Zotuluka lembani: laugh, mzere-watsopano.

>> locked := Zabodza.
>> security := Zoona.
security zoona: { locked := Zoona. }.
Zotuluka lembani: locked, mzere-watsopano.

>> n := 7.
(Zoona) zoona: { n := 9. }.
Zotuluka lembani: n.
